title: mf schema check
tags: [[CLI command]] Schema
kind: reference
summary: Check metarecords against the schema and list the violations

One line per violation, then a count; `--json` the raw answer
([[Schema endpoints]]). Exit code 0 with no violation, 1 with at least one, 2 on
an error.

```
abc…  film  rating  type             value of type string not allowed (expected: int)
abc…  -     rating  max_cardinality  3 rows, maximum is 1
Checked 1542 metarecords, 2 violations.
```
